WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.880
Tealy here. Some answers just sound right.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.420
Today, we make them prove it.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.480
An inference has to follow from the evidence.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.960
Sounding plausible isn't enough.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.000
If you can't point to it,

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.160
you can't pick it.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.520
A museum extended its Saturday hours after visitors requested

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.160
evening access. Now,

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.060
what does that support?

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:28.880
Choice one: the requests influenced the schedule.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.360
Can I point to it?

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.400
Yes: after visitors requested.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.900
That follows. Choice two:

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.160
attendance doubled. Where's that?

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.260
Nowhere. It's a new assumption.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:40.820
Out.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.360
So sort it into three bins.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.560
Stated: the hours were extended.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.760
Follows: the requests mattered.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:50.380
Merely possible: attendance went up.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:56.980
Your turn. A cafe added oat milk after customers kept asking.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:58.780
Does that prove sales rose?

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:00.240
Yes or no?

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:03.440
Go.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.110
No! All it supports is that the asking mattered.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:13.970
It says nothing about sales.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.950
And leave what you already know outside.

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:21.130
Outside knowledge can't replace evidence from the passage.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:23.790
For every choice,

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:25.890
put your finger on a specific fact.

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:28.150
No fact? Eliminate it.

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:29.790
Now hit Try this skill,

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:31.030
and happy hunting!
